  "description": "A romantic breakup is a common social event where a couple ends their romantic relationship. The meme references this as the initial context ('we broke up'), and the humor arises from the absurd suggestion that the relationship can be redefined as familial. This concept is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the premise of the meme.",
